(441030, 'Crew Assistant', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70459/crew-assistant', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-03-30 11:00:14', '', 'A well-established tanker shipping company in the Southern Suburbs of Athens is looking for a Crew Assistant to join our team. What we’re looking for: 1–2 years of relevant experience (shipping experience is a plus) Good organizational and communication skills Fluency in English Proficiency in standard office applications What you’ll do: Support crew recruitment and scheduling Assist with certifications and training coordination Ticketing and travel arrangements Maintain crew records and support daily operations This role is ideal for a motivated junior candidate who wants to grow in the maritime industry. Interested candidates are invited to submit their CV with the subject line: Crew Assistant', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
(441032, 'Secretary', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70458/secretary', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-03-30 11:00:16', '', 'Shipping company located in southern suburbs of Athens is looking for a positive, motivated, and highly organized Secretary who is fluent in Arabic. The ideal candidate will have excellent communication skills and interpersonal abilities, a friendly and professional attitude, while building strong relationships with Arabic-speaking partners. Interested applicants are invited to submit their CVs          ', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
(441033, 'Technical Coordinator', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70461/technical-coordinator', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-03-30 11:00:16', '', 'Well-established shipping company in Southern Athens, operating Bulk Carriers ships, is seeking a Technical Coordinator for its Fleet. Applicants must have: Experience in a similar office position for at least 3 years to deal with Class Certificates, PMS matters, and various other administrative technical matters Mechanical/Marine Engineering degree Experience in environmental regulations Fluency in English and computer literacy', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
(441034, 'Accountant / Assistant Accountant', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70460/accountant-assistant-accountant', 'Πειραιάς', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-03-30 11:00:18', '', 'Piraeus-based ship agency is seeking an Accountant / Assistant Accountant for our Piraeus office. Requirements: Relevant academic background in accounting 3-5 years of relevant work experience Good knowledge of Greek Accounting Standards (G.A.A.P / Ε.Λ.Π) Fluency in English and strong computer literacy  ', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
(441035, 'Operator', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70457/operator', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-03-30 11:00:20', 'Maran Tankers Management Inc.', 'Maran Tankers Management Inc. one of the world’s leading tanker operators and part of the Angelicoussis Group is looking for an experienced and motivated Operator. Please send your CV via our career site by clicking here.', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
(441036, 'Accountant', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70462/accountant', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-03-30 11:00:20', 'Zygos Maritime Services', 'Zygos Maritime Services is seeking to employ an accountant. Previous experience in maritime companies is necessary. University Degree, excellent command of English, communications, and computer literacy are required.', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση');
