(444388, 'Procurement Officer', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70674/procurement-officer', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-04-06 19:01:15', '', 'Tsakos Shipping and Trading S.A., Paleo Faliro, seek a Procurement Officer to join its Procurement Department, Stores and Spares parts. Required Qualifications: Bachelor’s degree holder in relevant field of Maritime Studies or Logistics & Supply Chain Management; Previous working experience in a shipping company’s Procurement Department will be considered as an advantage; Working experience related to Forwarding services will be considered as an advantage; Excellent command of the English language; Familiar with Purchasing Software and MS Office applications; Experience with KAPA E-PMS, DANAOS and other purchasing applications will be considered as an advantage; Strong organizational and communication skills; Ability to monitor effectiveness, quality and optimal monitoring of supply, cost efficiency; Ability to operate in a fast-paced working environment. If you are interested in joining a leading ship management company and being part of Shipping Group with a long tradition and history, you are invited to submit your CV to the HR Department. “Note: Any personal data included in your application will be legally processed (Art.  6 par. 1(b) of the GDPR) for the purposes of the selection procedure. Your personal data will be retained for six (6) months from the date it was provided to us and will be deleted - destroyed after that period. If you wish your personal data to be retained for a longer period, please explicitly state this when submitting your CV.  Note that under no circumstances will we retain your personal data for more than two (2) years. For any queries and further information on your personal data, you may contact our DPO Team at: [email protected].”                  ', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
