(447951, 'Technical Fleet Manager For Tankers', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70834/technical-fleet-manager-for-tankers', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-04-14 19:00:39', '', 'A leading shipping company is seeking a senior-level Technical Fleet Manager to take responsibility for the operational performance of its tanker fleet. Interested candidates may apply ', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
(447952, 'Superintendent Engineer for Wet Cargo', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70832/superintendent-engineer-for-wet-cargo', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-04-14 19:00:39', '', 'A shipping company is looking to hire an experienced Superintendent Engineer to support its wet cargo fleet operations. Interested candidates may forward their CV ', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
