(447973, 'Superintendent Engineer', 'https://www.careernet.gr/aggelia/70851/superintendent-engineer', 'Αθήνα', 'Δημοσιεύθηκε σήμερα', '2026-04-14 19:01:01', 'Oceangold Tankers Inc', 'Oceangold Tankers Inc. is seeking  an experienced Superintendent Engineer for a group of modern  MR, LR and LPG tankers. To qualify for the position applicants must  have  minimum below criteria: Polytechnic or Equivalent  engineering degree  either  as a Naval Architecture  /Mechanical Engineer or Chief Engineer licence with a  minimum 5 years office experience with Tankers company. Knowledge of regulatory  and industry requirements i.e. Class/Flag/SIRE/PSC /TMSA . Good command of English, as well as computer literacy are required. Drydocking experience. LPG experience is a strong advantage but not prerequisite. Danaos ERP operational  knowledge is an advantage but not prerequisite. The Candidate should be responsible for a Fleet of maximum  5 vessels and assigned with below tasks: Daily overall performance monitoring  including  troubleshooting , Class , Flag , SIRE arrangements. Docking preparation and execution. TMSA / ISM  office  preparation and execution. NBs Claims Handling. Travelling  flexibility to attend for routine and non-routine matters . Company operates a modern ECO Fleet  and provide a competitive remuneration package, with a  new building program on-going offering opportunity for career development. All applications will be treated with confidentiality.', 'Πλήρης Απασχόληση'),
